sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Operator
    participant API as API
    participant R as InvestigationRouter
    participant L as SpecialistInvestigationLoop
    participant E as EvidenceCollectionService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    O->>API: request investigation
    API->>R: select specialists
    R->>L: run bounded tools
    L->>E: collect Evidence
    E->>DB: persist evidence and result
    DB-->>API: diagnosis references
    API-->>O: investigation status
